From: CIX Neo Build System <noreply@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Platform: CIX: fix Sky1 validation platform builds

The upstream ArmPlatformPkg PrePi implementation was retired from the EDK2
revision used by the private development platform tree. Sky1P, Star1, and the
physical Sky1 platform already use the CIX-maintained replacement. Use that
replacement for the two remaining Sky1 validation platforms as well.

Also declare the package dependencies and null EC implementation that these
validation platforms require. The physical Sky1 platform and the newer SoC
platform descriptions already carry the equivalent declarations.

---
 Platform/CIX/Sky1/Emu/Emu.dsc                         | 1 +
 Platform/CIX/Sky1/Emu/Emu.fdf                         | 2 +-
 .../Sky1/Emu/Library/PlatformBootHookLib/PlatformBootHookLib.inf | 1 +
 Platform/CIX/Sky1/Drivers/DtbUpdateDxe/DtbUpdateDxe.inf | 1 +
 Platform/CIX/Sky1/Fpga/Fpga.dsc                       | 1 +
 Platform/CIX/Sky1/Fpga/Fpga.fdf                       | 2 +-
 .../Sky1/Fpga/Library/PlatformBootHookLib/PlatformBootHookLib.inf | 1 +
 .../Sky1/Library/PlatformEnvHookNullLib/PlatformEnvHookNullLib.inf | 1 +
 8 files changed, 9 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Platform/CIX/Sky1/Emu/Emu.dsc b/Platform/CIX/Sky1/Emu/Emu.dsc
--- a/Platform/CIX/Sky1/Emu/Emu.dsc
+++ b/Platform/CIX/Sky1/Emu/Emu.dsc
@@ -75,6 +75,7 @@
 # PlatformConfigParamsHookLib - RTC voltage drop detect + Get EC Board ID
 
   PlatformBootHookLib|Platform/CIX/Sky1/Emu/Library/PlatformBootHookLib/PlatformBootHookLib.inf
+  EcLib|Platform/CIX/CixPlatformCommonPkg/Library/EcLibNull/EcLibNull.inf
   ArmGenericTimerCounterLib|Platform/CIX/Sky1/Library/ArmGenericTimerPhyCounterLib/ArmGenericTimerPhyCounterLib.inf
 
 ################################################################################
